#. Speaker: OPERATOR
#. Delivery: Radio
#. Room: R01
#. Intent: Confirm deployment and establish the immediate objective.
#: missions/m01.md:R01
msgid "dialogue.m01.com01.l001"
msgstr "ROOK, implantação confirmada. Torre residencial Ashfall, setor sete."

#. Speaker: OPERATOR
#. Delivery: Radio
#. Room: R01
#. Intent: State the required mission sequence concisely.
#: missions/m01.md:R01
msgid "dialogue.m01.com01.l002"
msgstr "Restaure a energia do setor, recupere a equipe de segurança presa e chegue ao link de trânsito."

#. Speaker: VECTOR
#. Delivery: Radio
#. Room: R02
#. Intent: Establish that VECTOR is active elsewhere in Ashfall District.
#: missions/m01.md:R02
msgid "dialogue.m01.com02.l001"
msgstr "ROOK, VETOR. Estou a dois quarteirões a leste. O mesmo fogo, as mesmas comunicações mortas."

#. Speaker: VECTOR
#. Delivery: Radio
#. Room: R02
#. Intent: Direct attention toward the drones without stopping the tutorial.
#: missions/m01.md:R02
msgid "dialogue.m01.com02.l002"
msgstr "Algo está direcionando os drones para os andares ocupados. Vou rastrear daqui."

#. Speaker: SECURITY_OFFICER
#. Delivery: In person
#. Room: R06
#. Intent: Introduce the first contradiction in ROOK’s remembered history.
#: missions/m01.md:R06
msgid "dialogue.m01.com03.l001"
msgstr "Capitão?"

#. Speaker: SECURITY_OFFICER
#. Delivery: In person
#. Room: R06
#. Intent: Make the recognition specific without explaining it.
#: missions/m01.md:R06
msgid "dialogue.m01.com03.l002"
msgstr "Eu vi você morrer na ponte Kestrel. Há oito anos."

#. Speaker: ROOK
#. Delivery: In person
#. Room: R06
#. Intent: Keep ROOK controlled and focused on the rescue.
#: missions/m01.md:R06
msgid "dialogue.m01.com03.l003"
msgstr "Você pegou o soldado errado. Você pode se mover?"

#. Speaker: OPERATOR
#. Delivery: Radio
#. Room: R06
#. Intent: Offer a plausible explanation while redirecting the mission.
#: missions/m01.md:R06
msgid "dialogue.m01.com04.l001"
msgstr "A exposição neurológica pode produzir falso reconhecimento e projeção de identidade."

#. Speaker: OPERATOR
#. Delivery: Radio
#. Room: R06
#. Intent: Close the interruption and return the player to the objective.
#: missions/m01.md:R06
msgid "dialogue.m01.com04.l002"
msgstr "Proteja o sobrevivente e continue em trânsito."
